Package: dinarch
Title: Dynamic Innovation Negative Binomial ARCH Models for Count Time Series
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gudmund", "Hermansen", email = "gudmund.hermansen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-7256-867X"))
Description: Provides tools for fitting, simulating, and analysing Dynamic 
    Innovation Negative Binomial ARCH (NB-DINARCH) models for count time 
    series data. Supports maximum likelihood estimation via Nelder-Mead 
    optimisation, optional Bayesian inference via Stan, exogenous covariates, 
    and dynamic simulation of count time series. Designed for applications 
    in conflict research and event count modelling.
